6.0 Configuration
Application behavior can be modified using environment variables set in the docker-compose.yml file.
•	LLM_BASE_URL: The full URL to the LLM server's OpenAI-compatible endpoint. (Default: http://llm-server:8080/v1)
•	MODEL_NAME: The model identifier sent in the API request. (Default: local-model)
•	TIKA_URL: The full URL to the Tika server. (Default: http://tika-server:9998)
7.0 Interface Specifications (API)
7.1 Front-End to LLM Server
•	Protocol: HTTP POST
•	Endpoint: /v1/chat/completions (as specified by LLM_BASE_URL)
•	Body Format: Standard OpenAI ChatCompletion request format. The messages payload is an array of objects, each with a role (system, user, assistant) and content.
•	Multimodal Content: For prompts including images, the content of the user message is an array of parts, including {"type": "text", ...} and {"type": "image_url", "image_url": {"url": "data:image/jpeg;base64,..."}}.
7.2 Front-End to Tika Server
•	Protocol: HTTP PUT
•	Endpoint: /tika (as specified by TIKA_URL)
•	Body Format: The raw bytes of the uploaded document (application/octet-stream).
•	Response Format: JSON, from which the content key is extracted.

